#==============================================================================================
#
#   tree_node_2 - TreeNode<T>: the subtree, child, sibling and ancestor traversals and
#                 visit_edges
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/TreeNode.h (lines 220-477): the template members that walk the
#       tree with a callback or look for a node of a class, and visit_edges. Conventions as in
#       tree_node_1: the T itself through HasTreeNode[T], a ClassInfo for a class template
#       argument, a TraversalCallback[T] or IterationCallback[T] for a lambda.
#
